"},{"iso_3166_1":"US","title":"Middle Man","type":""},{"iso_3166_1":"HK","title":"皇家師姐之中間人","type":""},{"iso_3166_1":"US","title":"In The Line Of Duty 5 - Middle Man","type":""}],"externalIds":{"imdb_id":"tt0094376","wikidata_id":null,"facebook_id":null,"instagram_id":null,"twitter_id":null},"keywords":[],"releaseDates":[{"iso_3166_1":"DE","release_dates":[{"certification":"18","descriptors":[],"iso_639_1":"","note":"","release_date":"2026-12-04T00:00:00.000Z","type":5}]},{"iso_3166_1":"HK","release_dates":[{"certification":"","descriptors":[],"iso_639_1":"","note":"","release_date":"1990-06-15T00:00:00.000Z","type":3}]}],"translations":[{"iso_639_1":"en","iso_3166_1":"US","name":"English","english_name":"English","title":"In the Line of Duty 5: Middle Man","overview":"When he is framed for being a spy because of his friend's illegal activities, David must escape from police, CIA, and assassins with the help of his cousin.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"de","iso_3166_1":"DE","name":"Deutsch","english_name":"German","title":"Red Force 2","overview":"Die Marines David und Allan machen in Hongkong Urlaub. Als Allan sich Rauschgift beschaffen will, wird ihm dies zum tödlichen Verhängnis. Was keiner ahnen konnte, ist dass Allan seine Finger beim K.G.B. mit im Spiel hatte. David gerät als Mitwisser ins Kreuzfeuer. Hoffnungslos gejagt, bittet er seine Cousine Yeung um Hilfe...","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"cs","iso_3166_1":"CZ","name":"Český","english_name":"Czech","title":"Red Force 5","overview":"David, bratranec místní policejní inspektorky Madam Yeung přijde se svým přítelem Alanem a vlastní vojenskou jednotkou do Honkongu. Jejich předpokládaný oddechový pobyt je přerušen vraždou Alana při pouliční koupi marihuany. Tím pro Davida a jeho přítelkyni May začíná hororové peklo, které podmínila okolnost, že zabitý Alan byl vlastně vyzvědačem. Madam Yeung i proti odmítavým pokynům svých nadřízených začne pomáhat neštastnému bratranci. Společně zjistí, že stopy už tak zamotaného případu vedou až do Jižní Korei, kde sídlí hlavni generálský štáb. To však ještě netušili, že o hlavní překvapení se postará CIA, která všechno sleduje z dostatečného odstupu....","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"pl","iso_3166_1":"PL","name":"Polski","english_name":"Polish","title":"In the Line of Duty V: Middle Man","overview":"David (David Wu) zostaje wrobiony w szpiegostwo z powodu nielegalnych działań przyjaciela. Teraz musi uciekać przed policją, C.I.A. oraz zabójcami.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"el","iso_3166_1":"GR","name":"ελληνικά","english_name":"Greek","title":"Middle Man","overview":"","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"fr","iso_3166_1":"CA","name":"Français","english_name":"French","title":"Le Sens du devoir 5","overview":"L’inspecteur Yeung vient en aide à son cousin David, suspecté du meurtre de son coéquipier, Alan. Ils vont se confronter à une société secrète au pouvoir international.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"fr","iso_3166_1":"FR","name":"Français","english_name":"French","title":"Le Sens du devoir 5","overview":"L’inspecteur Yeung vient en aide à son cousin David, suspecté du meurtre de son coéquipier, Alan. Ils vont se confronter à une société secrète au pouvoir international.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"ko","iso_3166_1":"KR","name":"한국어/조선말","english_name":"Korean","title":"예스마담 5 - 중간인","overview":"암흑가의 끄나풀인 친구 알렌의 죽음으로 방금 제대한 오 대위가 모든 범죄의 혐의를 뒤집어 쓴다. 특히 마약과 군사기밀 스파이로 지목되어 CIA에 체포, 구금되자 누나인 양리칭은 더이상 좌시 할 수만은 없다. 마침내 경차라에서 표를 던지고 동생 오대유의 결백을 밝히려 하지만 복잡하게 얽힌 조직의 정체는 오리무중이고 비정한 암흑가의 생리만 이 두형제를 사면초가에 빠뜨리는데...","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"zh","iso_3166_1":"CN","name":"普通话","english_name":"Mandarin","title":"皇家师姐5：中间人","overview":"　　当红主持吴大维扮演一位正直的美籍华人海军，样貌和身材都甚具说服力。真一贩卖美国情报的组织，其成员凡是暴露身份者均遭杀害。亚伦是其组织成员之一，他与大维同在美国海军陆战队复役，只因亚伦遇劫身亡。与他有过接触的人全被追杀，大维不甘被陷害，突围而出找到在警局任职的表姐，他们结伴而行前往韩国直捣虎穴，与“上将”正面决斗。","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"ru","iso_3166_1":"RU","name":"Pусский","english_name":"Russian","title":"При исполнении 5: Посредник","overview":"Морской пехотинец Дэвид, двоюродный брат крутой полицейской дамы Янг, во время служебного отпуска оказывается втянутым в международный скандал со шпионажем. Сестра помогает ему скрываться от мафии, полиции и ЦРУ, попутно выясняя, чьи грехи повесили на Дэвида.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"de","iso_3166_1":"AT","name":"Deutsch","english_name":"German","title":"Red Force 2","overview":"Die Marines David und Allan machen in Hongkong Urlaub. Als Allan sich Rauschgift beschaffen will, wird ihm dies zum tödlichen Verhängnis. Was keiner ahnen konnte, ist dass Allan seine Finger beim K.G.B. mit im Spiel hatte. David gerät als Mitwisser ins Kreuzfeuer. Hoffnungslos gejagt, bittet er seine Cousine Yeung um Hilfe...","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"vi","iso_3166_1":"VN","name":"Tiếng Việt","english_name":"Vietnamese","title":"Tiêu Diệt Nhân Chứng 5: Người Trung Lập","overview":"Khi bị buộc tội làm gián điệp vì những hoạt động bất hợp pháp của bạn mình, David phải trốn thoát khỏi cảnh sát, CIA và những kẻ ám sát với sự giúp đỡ của anh họ.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"zh","iso_3166_1":"HK","name":"普通话","english_name":"Mandarin","title":"皇家師姐５：中間人","overview":"當紅主持吳大維扮演一位正直的美籍華裔海軍，樣貌與身材都甚具説服力。真一販賣美國情報的組織，其成員凡是曝露身分者均遭殺害。亞倫是其組織成員之一，他與大維同在美國海軍陸戰隊復役，只因亞倫遇劫身亡。與他有過接觸的人全被追殺，大維不甘被陷害，突圍而出找到在警局任職的表姐，他們結伴而行前往韓國直搗虎穴，與「上將」正面決鬥。","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"nl","iso_3166_1":"NL","name":"Nederlands","english_name":"Dutch","title":"","overview":"Inspecteur Yeung schiet zijn neef David te hulp, die verdacht wordt van de moord op zijn teamgenoot Alan. Ze zullen de confrontatie aangaan met een geheim genootschap met internationale macht.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"pt","iso_3166_1":"BR","name":"Português","english_name":"Portuguese","title":"In the Line of Duty 5: Middle Man","overview":"David é um militar que acaba de retornar de serviço na Coréia, e encontra-se com sua prima, a Inspetora Yeung. David e uma garota chamada May, acabam presenciando o assassinato de seu amigo Alan, que era envolvido com uma organização que vendia segredos políticos americanos. Por ter presenciado o assassinato, esta organização está agora atrás de David e May, além da própria polícia de Hong Kong e a CIA, que os têm como suspeitos pelo assassinato de Alan. David agora tenta escapar e também vingar a morte do amigo Alan, e para isto tem a grande ajuda de sua prima Yeung, que se vê obrigada a ir contra a lei para ajudar seu primo.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"tr","iso_3166_1":"TR","name":"Türkçe","english_name":"Turkish","title":"Görevimiz Öldürmek 5","overview":"Deniz piyadeleri David ve Allan, Hong Kong'da tatil yapmaktadır. Allan uyuşturucu temin etmek isteyince, bu onun için ölümcül bir sona yol açar. Ancak kimsenin tahmin edemeyeceği şey, Allan’ın KGB ile bağlantılı işler içinde olduğudur. Olan biteni bilen David, bir anda ateş hattının ortasında kalır. Umutsuzca peşine düşülünce, kuzeni Yeung'dan yardım istemek zorunda kalır...","tagline":""}],"videos":[],"images":{"posters":[{"file_path":"/7AYF40cerqwvFEx2QL6vKCwAioE.jpg","width":1000,"height":1500,"iso_639_1":"en","vote_average":2.278,"vote_count":3},{"file_path":"/dLZG4fLZHe38zP1gv1kVwEtwK4j.jpg","width":1000,"height":1500,"iso_639_1":"en","vote_average":1.222,"vote_count":3},{"file_path":"/uc73ixal4BY6kvis0FnrIVxhVeY.jpg","width":1000,"height":1500,"iso_639_1":"en","vote_average":0.166,"vote_count":1},{"file_path":"/hOZwnt6XgWEhf8HNfX7gA0VAYo1.jpg","width":1000,"height":1500,"iso_639_1":"fr","vote_average":0.166,"vote_count":1},{"file_path":"/tRNnvcBdC8wD6m4LWAsafWulRjl.jpg","width":2000,"height":3000,"iso_639_1":"en","vote_average":0.166,"vote_count":1},{"file_path":"/wiHNcydk8aOMZ9m86vkyBLyHeNl.jpg","width":500,"height":750,"iso_639_1":"en","vote_average":0,"vote_count":0},{"file_path":"/lFYglBBn2JJ3ofwhIcs93wWc7Fe.jpg","width":1000,"height":1500,"iso_639_1":"fr","vote_average":0,"vote_count":0}],"backdrops":[{"file_path":"/f8073B4vIGEH4X1C16cGtPNHlk4.jpg","width":3840,"height":2160,"iso_639_1":null,"vote_average":3.334,"vote_count":2},{"file_path":